OL,3,GNEWSAPrimary school to cut reception
OL,4,Aplaces as pupil numbers fall
OL,5,
OL,6,FFalling pupil numbers have forced a
OL,7,Fprimary school to cut the number of
OL,8,Fchildren it can take each year.
OL,10,FSt John the Baptist Church of England
OL,11,FPrimary School in Titchfield Common
OL,12,Fwill reduce its Reception intake from
OL,13,F60 to 41 after the change was approved
OL,14,Fby the Schools Adjudicator.
OL,16,FThe move comes as falling birth rates
OL,17,Flead to fewer children entering
OL,18,Fschools, with Hampshire County Council
OL,19,Fsaying it has had to consider a number
OL,20,Fof similar reductions across the county
OL,21,Fin recent years.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,336,330,200,160,0,100
