OL,3,GNEWSAPrimary school to cut reception
OL,4,Aplaces as pupil numbers fall
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe adjudicator's decision, published
OL,7,Fin a report this month, said the school
OL,8,Fhad 39 pupils in its current Reception
OL,9,Fyear and that 41 places had been
OL,10,Foffered for September 2026.
